@sprint2 @review @letters
Feature: [Sprint 2] Meninjau dan Menindaklanjuti Pengajuan Surat oleh Ketua RT
  As a Ketua RT
  I want to review incoming letter applications and approve, request revision, or reject them
  So that every resident request is followed up with a clear decision

  Background:
    Given the RTConnect backend application is ready
    And the resident "resident@example.test" and the RT head "rt@example.test" are logged in with password "LocalTestOnly#2026"
    And the resident has a new "DOM" application with "digital" signature

  Scenario: Ketua RT melihat pengajuan baru di antrean masuk
    When the RT head opens the incoming application queue
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response JSON should indicate success
    And the queue should contain the application

  Scenario: Ketua RT menyetujui pengajuan surat
    When the RT head sends decision "approve" with note "Data sudah sesuai"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response field "data.status" should be "disetujui"
    And the application status in the database should be "disetujui"

  Scenario: Ketua RT meminta revisi disertai catatan perbaikan
    When the RT head sends decision "revise" with note "Keperluan kurang jelas, sebutkan nama bank"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response field "data.status" should be "perlu_revisi"
    And the response field "data.catatan_revisi" should be "Keperluan kurang jelas, sebutkan nama bank"
    And the application status in the database should be "perlu_revisi"

  Scenario: Permintaan revisi tanpa catatan ditolak sistem
    When the RT head sends decision "revise" without a note
    Then the response status code should be 400
    And the response JSON should indicate failure
    And the response field "error" should be "NOTE_REQUIRED"
    And the application status in the database should be "diajukan"

  Scenario: Ketua RT menolak pengajuan dengan alasan
    When the RT head sends decision "reject" with note "Bukan warga RT 04"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response field "data.status" should be "ditolak"
    And the application status in the database should be "ditolak"

  Scenario: Penolakan tanpa alasan ditolak sistem
    When the RT head sends decision "reject" without a note
    Then the response status code should be 400
    And the response field "error" should be "REASON_REQUIRED"

  Scenario: Aksi keputusan yang tidak dikenal ditolak
    When the RT head sends decision "hapus" with note "coba"
    Then the response status code should be 400
    And the response field "error" should be "INVALID_ACTION"

  Scenario: Pengajuan yang sedang menunggu revisi warga tidak dapat diputuskan ulang
    Given the RT head has requested a revision with note "Lengkapi tujuan"
    When the RT head sends decision "approve" with note "Langsung setujui"
    Then the response status code should be 409
    And the response field "error" should be "INVALID_STATUS"
    And the application status in the database should be "perlu_revisi"

  Scenario: Warga tidak berwenang memberi keputusan
    When the resident tries to send decision "approve" on the application
    Then the response status code should be 403
    And the response JSON should indicate failure
